  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your faith purifies your bloodstream.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Pure Faith<sup>UM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your bonus on saving throws against poisons is increased by an amount equal to one-half your mythic tier. In addition, you may expend one use of your mythic power as a standard action to use neutralize poison on yourself, using your character level plus your mythic tier as your caster level. If you successfully neutralize the poison, you can capture a vial of perfectly purified blood in a suitable container as a full-round action. This purified blood functions as holy water (if good or neutral) or unholy water (if evil or neutral), though it loses its potency after 1 minute.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-n-s-feats#toc19\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
